From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikolajs Agafonovs <nikolajs.agafonovs@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:28:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] libcss: mask-image and the mask shorthands

A new property mask-image (none or a url(), not inherited, like
list-style-image) with the shorthands mask, -webkit-mask and
-webkit-mask-image: the shorthands keep the first layer's url() (or none:
gradients are not supported) and read past the other values and layers.
The computed value is css_computed_mask_image().  select_config.py lists
the property; select_generator.py now also writes the custom properties
pointer, which was added to autogenerated_computed.h by hand, so that the
header can be generated again.
